    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2016_0161","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Nnamdi Mbeki talks about what the gallery cleaner threw away. There is a long passage about a single brush, which the artist calls "the elder".</Description>
